# PSID microdata — NEVER commit.
# PSID's conditions of use prohibit redistribution; the extracts are obtained
# per-user from the Data Center after registration. scripts/psid_sample.py
# reads them from here, and PSID_DATA.md records the variable codes needed to
# re-pull them, so nothing is lost by keeping the data out of the repo.
PSID-data/
